WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.764
Brands grow by being easy to think of and easy to buy.

00:00:03.814 --> 00:00:08.722
That's mental and physical availability, built through reach and distinctive assets.

00:00:09.433 --> 00:00:11.046
A shopper wants a snack.

00:00:11.096 --> 00:00:11.896
Crumb and Co pops into her head,

00:00:11.438 --> 00:00:14.725
and it's right there on the shelf.

00:00:14.775 --> 00:00:16.407
Sale made.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.430
Now the opposite.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.767
Nike pulled back from stores and chased only the last click.

00:00:21.817 --> 00:00:24.986
Fewer people saw it, and awareness faded.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.926
Use it like this: check both.

00:00:27.976 --> 00:00:31.970
Will buyers think of you, and can they find you easily?
